# A node says it may retire on a stale belief: the configuration it
# believes in force need not be bound to the operator's watermark. A node
# that a later configuration names again may then be retired, and that
# configuration loses a member for good. The "retired" excuse covers only a
# node an effective floor named, so the loss must show.
excuse: node: retired
file: crates/lib/paros-core/src/node/gc.rs
--- find
            && watermark > self.last_member_ballot
            && self.acceptors_since == watermark;
--- replace
            && watermark > self.last_member_ballot;
--- end
